    <h2>6. Final Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Keep your <code>identity.pem</code> and passphrase safe.</li>
      <li>Your public DID is safe to share.</li>
      <li>Older messages disappear from the main view — this is normal.</li>
      <li>Server errors (502/timeout) are common when many people are joining.</li>
    </ul>

